{"id":"4dcb60fd80f242a0","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-extern-preserves.md","title":"thm-externalization-preserves","display":"thm-externalization-preserves","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"7.3","label":"16-thm-extern-preserves","aliases":["16-thm-extern-preserves","16-thm--extern-preserves"],"display":"thm-externalization-preserves","depends_on":["[[16-df-externalization]]","[[16-df-internal-category]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]","[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","[[16-df-split-fibration-category]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]"],"source":"Proposition 7.3.8 and proof, pp. 425–426 (PDF 445–446); Exercise 1.10.6, pp. 116–117 (PDF 136–137)","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7.3"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-extern-preserves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-extern-preserves</span><span>16-thm--extern-preserves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-externalization-preserves"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e85a3cc0dff01389\" href=\"?note=e85a3cc0dff01389\" title=\"16-df-externalization\">16-df-externalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3af0cd796b55bbd7\" href=\"?note=3af0cd796b55bbd7\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration-category\">16-df-split-fibration-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 7.3.8 and proof, pp. 425–426 (PDF 445–446); Exercise 1.10.6, pp. 116–117 (PDF 136–137)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定足够大的 Grothendieck 宇宙，所有下述对象集、箭头集和结构族均在其中编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 有指定有限极限；积配对、积箭头及拉回配对采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75d304b3477bee01\" href=\"?note=75d304b3477bee01\" title=\"16-df-internal-category\">16-df-internal-category</a> 的泛性质。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D,T\">\\(C,D,T\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 中的内部范畴，源靶为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span>，内部复合按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(g,f)\">\\((g,f)\\)</span> 排列。内部函子恒等与复合逐分量计算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar p=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa_p)\">\\(\\bar p=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa_p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar q=(\\mathcal D,q,\\kappa_q)\">\\(\\bar q=(\\mathcal D,q,\\kappa_q)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar r=(\\mathcal R,r,\\kappa_r)\">\\(\\bar r=(\\mathcal R,r,\\kappa_r)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3af0cd796b55bbd7\" href=\"?note=3af0cd796b55bbd7\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration-category\">16-df-split-fibration-category</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 对象；该记号保留分裂选择。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatTrans}\">\\(\\mathrm{NatTrans}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a> 的精确接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)\">\\(\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)\">\\(\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)\\)</span> 按下文的六元组构造；只有在已固定同一分裂时才省略横线。</li>\n<li>积箭头公式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;,D&#39;\">\\(C&#39;,D&#39;\\)</span> 也为内部范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in O_{C,C&#39;}\">\\(F\\in O_{C,C&#39;}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in O_{D,D&#39;}\">\\(G\\in O_{D,D&#39;}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar p&#39;,\\bar q&#39;\">\\(\\bar p&#39;,\\bar q&#39;\\)</span> 为同一基底上的分裂纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar p&#39;}\">\\(H\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar p&#39;}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in O_{\\bar q,\\bar q&#39;}\">\\(K\\in O_{\\bar q,\\bar q&#39;}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\boxtimes K\">\\(H\\boxtimes K\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D\\)</span> 到相应目标总范畴的同基底积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a> 中对象、箭头两分量均为恒等函数的记录。</li>\n<li>构造内部积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\times D\">\\(C\\times D\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_C,r_D:C_1\\times D_1\\to C_1,D_1\">\\(r_C,r_D:C_1\\times D_1\\to C_1,D_1\\)</span> 是积投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{C,D}\">\\(P_{C,D}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_C\\times s_D\">\\(s_C\\times s_D\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_C\\times t_D\">\\(t_C\\times t_D\\)</span> 的拉回，投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b:P_{C,D}\\to C_1\\times D_1\">\\(a,b:P_{C,D}\\to C_1\\times D_1\\)</span> 分别取后继与先行箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1\">\\(P_1\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_1\\)</span> 与自身的拉回，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_{P_1}:P_1\\to1\">\\(!_{P_1}:P_1\\to1\\)</span> 是唯一箭头。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_C\">\\(\\pi_C\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_C\">\\(\\kappa_C\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e85a3cc0dff01389\" href=\"?note=e85a3cc0dff01389\" title=\"16-df-externalization\">16-df-externalization</a> 的总范畴、投影和指定分裂。外部化的箭头使用完整记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(I,x),(J,y),u,a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(I,x),(J,y),u,a\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}(F)\\)</span> 是其间的函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X_{C,D}\">\\(\\mathcal X_{C,D}\\)</span> 是下面由该作用构造的 Hom 范畴函子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SExp}(\\bar p,\\bar q;\\bar r,w)\">\\(\\mathrm{SExp}(\\bar p,\\bar q;\\bar r,w)\\)</span> 在 Assertion 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 为内部范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:E\\times C\\to D\">\\(v:E\\times C\\to D\\)</span> 为候选内部函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:\\mathcal R\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(w:\\mathcal R\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为候选函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A^i,\\mathcal A^s\">\\(\\mathcal A^i,\\mathcal A^s\\)</span> 分别在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in O_{E\\times C,D}\">\\(v\\in O_{E\\times C,D}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in O_{\\bar r\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q}\">\\(w\\in O_{\\bar r\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q}\\)</span> 的分支内构造。末式只在这两个指数结构存在时断言其外部化同构，不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 中所有指数存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G(C,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(F_0:C_0\\to D_0,F_1:C_1\\to D_1)\\mid\ns_DF_1=F_0s_C\\land t_DF_1=F_0t_C\\},\\\\\nO_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathcal G(C,D)\\mid\nF_1e_C=e_DF_0\\land F_1m_C=m_D\\langle F_1\\pi_1,F_1\\pi_2\\rangle\\},\\\\\nA_{C,D}(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:C_0\\to D_1\\mid s_D\\alpha=F_0\\land t_D\\alpha=G_0\\},\\\\\nH_{C,D}(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in A_{C,D}(F,G)\\mid\nm_D\\langle G_1,\\alpha s_C\\rangle=m_D\\langle\\alpha t_C,F_1\\rangle\\},\\\\\nM_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_{C,D}\\land\\alpha\\in H_{C,D}(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_{C,D}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\qquad t_{C,D}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_{C,D}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,e_DF_0\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{C,D}(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,m_D\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{C,D},M_{C,D},s_{C,D},t_{C,D},e_{C,D},c_{C,D}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G(C,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(F_0:C_0\\to D_0,F_1:C_1\\to D_1)\\mid\ns_DF_1=F_0s_C\\land t_DF_1=F_0t_C\\},\\\\\nO_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathcal G(C,D)\\mid\nF_1e_C=e_DF_0\\land F_1m_C=m_D\\langle F_1\\pi_1,F_1\\pi_2\\rangle\\},\\\\\nA_{C,D}(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:C_0\\to D_1\\mid s_D\\alpha=F_0\\land t_D\\alpha=G_0\\},\\\\\nH_{C,D}(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in A_{C,D}(F,G)\\mid\nm_D\\langle G_1,\\alpha s_C\\rangle=m_D\\langle\\alpha t_C,F_1\\rangle\\},\\\\\nM_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_{C,D}\\land\\alpha\\in H_{C,D}(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_{C,D}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\qquad t_{C,D}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_{C,D}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,e_DF_0\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{C,D}(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,m_D\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{C,D},M_{C,D},s_{C,D},t_{C,D},e_{C,D},c_{C,D}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\bar p,\\bar q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\mid\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D)\\land qF=p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nF\\kappa_p(u,Y)=\\kappa_q(u,FY)\\},\\\\\nH_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\mid\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\alpha:F\\Rightarrow G)\n\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ q\\alpha_X=\\operatorname{id}_{pX}\\},\\\\\nM_{\\bar p,\\bar q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\land\\alpha\\in H_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\qquad t_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,(\\operatorname{id}_{FX})_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,(\\beta_X\\alpha_X)_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\bar p,\\bar q},M_{\\bar p,\\bar q},s_{\\bar p,\\bar q},t_{\\bar p,\\bar q},e_{\\bar p,\\bar q},c_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\bar p,\\bar q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\mid\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D)\\land qF=p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nF\\kappa_p(u,Y)=\\kappa_q(u,FY)\\},\\\\\nH_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F,G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\mid\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\alpha:F\\Rightarrow G)\n\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ q\\alpha_X=\\operatorname{id}_{pX}\\},\\\\\nM_{\\bar p,\\bar q}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\land\\alpha\\in H_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\qquad t_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,(\\operatorname{id}_{FX})_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,(\\beta_X\\alpha_X)_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\bar p,\\bar q},M_{\\bar p,\\bar q},s_{\\bar p,\\bar q},t_{\\bar p,\\bar q},e_{\\bar p,\\bar q},c_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nm_{C\\times D}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle m_C\\langle r_Ca,r_Cb\\rangle,m_D\\langle r_Da,r_Db\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nC\\times D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C_0\\times D_0,C_1\\times D_1,s_C\\times s_D,t_C\\times t_D,e_C\\times e_D,m_{C\\times D}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,\\operatorname{id}_1,\\operatorname{id}_1,\\operatorname{id}_1,!_{P_1}\\rangle,\\\\\nF\\times G&amp;\\coloneqq(F_0\\times G_0,F_1\\times G_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0},\\operatorname{id}_{C_1}),\n\\qquad (GF)_i\\coloneqq G_iF_i\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(C\\times D)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nm_{C\\times D}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle m_C\\langle r_Ca,r_Cb\\rangle,m_D\\langle r_Da,r_Db\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nC\\times D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C_0\\times D_0,C_1\\times D_1,s_C\\times s_D,t_C\\times t_D,e_C\\times e_D,m_{C\\times D}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,\\operatorname{id}_1,\\operatorname{id}_1,\\operatorname{id}_1,!_{P_1}\\rangle,\\\\\nF\\times G&amp;\\coloneqq(F_0\\times G_0,F_1\\times G_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0},\\operatorname{id}_{C_1}),\n\\qquad (GF)_i\\coloneqq G_iF_i\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(C\\times D)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\times}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,Y)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\times\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D\\mid pX=qY\\},\\\\\nM_{\\times}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(f,g)\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E\\times\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D\\mid pf=qg\\},\\\\\ns_{\\times}(f,g)&amp;\\coloneqq(sf,sg),\\qquad t_{\\times}(f,g)\\coloneqq(tf,tg),\\\\\ne_{\\times}(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_X,\\operatorname{id}_Y),\\\\\nc_{\\times}((f&#39;,g&#39;),(f,g))&amp;\\coloneqq(f&#39;f,g&#39;g),\\\\\n\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\times},M_{\\times},s_{\\times},t_{\\times},e_{\\times},c_{\\times}\\rangle,\\\\\n(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_0(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq pX,\n\\qquad(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_1(f,g)\\coloneqq pf,\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\times}(u,(X,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq(\\kappa_p(u,X),\\kappa_q(u,Y)),\\\\\n\\bar p\\boxtimes\\bar q&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D,\n\\langle(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_0,(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_1\\rangle,\\kappa_{\\times}),\\\\\n\\bar1_{\\mathcal B}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal B,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B},\\kappa_{\\mathcal B}),\n\\qquad\\kappa_{\\mathcal B}(u,Y)\\coloneqq u,\\\\\n(H\\boxtimes K)_0(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(HX,KY),\n\\qquad(H\\boxtimes K)_1(f,g)\\coloneqq(Hf,Kg).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\times}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,Y)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\times\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D\\mid pX=qY\\},\\\\\nM_{\\times}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(f,g)\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E\\times\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D\\mid pf=qg\\},\\\\\ns_{\\times}(f,g)&amp;\\coloneqq(sf,sg),\\qquad t_{\\times}(f,g)\\coloneqq(tf,tg),\\\\\ne_{\\times}(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_X,\\operatorname{id}_Y),\\\\\nc_{\\times}((f&#39;,g&#39;),(f,g))&amp;\\coloneqq(f&#39;f,g&#39;g),\\\\\n\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\times},M_{\\times},s_{\\times},t_{\\times},e_{\\times},c_{\\times}\\rangle,\\\\\n(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_0(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq pX,\n\\qquad(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_1(f,g)\\coloneqq pf,\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\times}(u,(X,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq(\\kappa_p(u,X),\\kappa_q(u,Y)),\\\\\n\\bar p\\boxtimes\\bar q&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D,\n\\langle(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_0,(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_1\\rangle,\\kappa_{\\times}),\\\\\n\\bar1_{\\mathcal B}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mathcal B,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B},\\kappa_{\\mathcal B}),\n\\qquad\\kappa_{\\mathcal B}(u,Y)\\coloneqq u,\\\\\n(H\\boxtimes K)_0(X,Y)&amp;\\coloneqq(HX,KY),\n\\qquad(H\\boxtimes K)_1(f,g)\\coloneqq(Hf,Kg).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar p\\boxtimes\\bar q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\bar1_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar p\\boxtimes\\bar q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\bar1_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ext}(C),\\pi_C,\\kappa_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_0(I,x)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,F_0x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_1\\langle(I,x),(J,y),u,a\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,F_0x),(J,F_0y),u,F_1a\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_0,\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ext}(\\alpha))_{(I,x)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,F_0x),(I,G_0x),\\operatorname{id}_I,\\alpha x\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_0(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(F),\\\\\n(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_1\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Ext}(F),\\operatorname{Ext}(G),\\operatorname{Ext}(\\alpha)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal X_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_0,(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}\\bigl(\\mathcal X_{C,D},\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D),\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D))\\bigr)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ext}(C),\\pi_C,\\kappa_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_0(I,x)&amp;\\coloneqq(I,F_0x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_1\\langle(I,x),(J,y),u,a\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,F_0x),(J,F_0y),u,F_1a\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_0,\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ext}(\\alpha))_{(I,x)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,F_0x),(I,G_0x),\\operatorname{id}_I,\\alpha x\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_0(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(F),\\\\\n(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_1\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Ext}(F),\\operatorname{Ext}(G),\\operatorname{Ext}(\\alpha)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal X_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_0,(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}\\bigl(\\mathcal X_{C,D},\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D),\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D))\\bigr)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_0(F)&amp;\\coloneqq v(F\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_1\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle v(F\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),v(G\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),v_1(\\alpha\\times e_C)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A^i_{T,v}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_0,(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nv\\in O_{E\\times C,D}\\land(\\forall T)\\bigl[\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(T)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v},\\operatorname{IFun}(T,E),\\operatorname{IFun}(T\\times C,D))\\bigr],\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq w(H\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\langle w(H\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),w(K\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),\n\\bigl(w(\\alpha_Z,\\operatorname{id}_X)\\bigr)_{(Z,X)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal T\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal E)}\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_0,(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SExp}(\\bar p,\\bar q;\\bar r,w)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in O_{\\bar r\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q}\n\\land(\\forall\\bar t=(\\mathcal T,t,\\kappa_t)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w},\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar t,\\bar r),\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar t\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists F\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar q})(\\exists G\\in O_{\\bar q,\\bar p})\\\nGF=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\land FG=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_0(F)&amp;\\coloneqq v(F\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_1\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle v(F\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),v(G\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),v_1(\\alpha\\times e_C)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A^i_{T,v}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_0,(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nv\\in O_{E\\times C,D}\\land(\\forall T)\\bigl[\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(T)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v},\\operatorname{IFun}(T,E),\\operatorname{IFun}(T\\times C,D))\\bigr],\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq w(H\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\left\\langle w(H\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),w(K\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),\n\\bigl(w(\\alpha_Z,\\operatorname{id}_X)\\bigr)_{(Z,X)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal T\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal E)}\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_0,(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SExp}(\\bar p,\\bar q;\\bar r,w)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in O_{\\bar r\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q}\n\\land(\\forall\\bar t=(\\mathcal T,t,\\kappa_t)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w},\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar t,\\bar r),\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar t\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists F\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar q})(\\exists G\\in O_{\\bar q,\\bar p})\\\nGF=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\land FG=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}),\\bar1_{\\mathcal B})&amp;,\n\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C\\times D),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C)\\boxtimes\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D))&amp;,\n\\\\\n\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)\\land\n\\mathrm{SExp}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D);\\bar r,w)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(E),\\bar r).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}),\\bar1_{\\mathcal B})&amp;,\n\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C\\times D),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C)\\boxtimes\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D))&amp;,\n\\\\\n\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)\\land\n\\mathrm{SExp}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D);\\bar r,w)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(E),\\bar r).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里使用严格保留指定分裂的函子组成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{SF}\\)</span>，对应原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fib}_{\\mathrm{split}}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fib}_{\\mathrm{split}}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>；若改为任意笛卡尔函子，不能直接继承本页的局部同构结论。</li>\n<li>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\to\\operatorname{Ext}(D)\">\\(H:\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\to\\operatorname{Ext}(D)\\)</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0\">\\(F_0\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(C_0,\\operatorname{id}_{C_0})\">\\(H(C_0,\\operatorname{id}_{C_0})\\)</span> 的第二分量；从泛垂直箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{id}_{C_1},\\operatorname{id}_{C_1})\">\\((\\operatorname{id}_{C_1},\\operatorname{id}_{C_1})\\)</span> 的像恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1\">\\(F_1\\)</span>。严格保留分裂迫使所有对象和箭头上的值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0x\">\\(F_0x\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1a\">\\(F_1a\\)</span>。自然变换同样由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C_0,\\operatorname{id}_{C_0})\">\\((C_0,\\operatorname{id}_{C_0})\\)</span> 处的分量恢复，给出所示 hom 范畴同构。</li>\n<li>积的同构把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I,\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\((I,\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span> 送到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I,x),(I,y))\">\\(((I,x),(I,y))\\)</span>，在箭头上亦逐分量作用。指数项保留原书的存在条件及 split-fibred 指数含义；本页没有声称任意有限极限基范畴都使这些指数存在。</li>\n<li>指数保持的本地展开：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_I\">\\(D_I\\)</span> 是离散内部范畴，对象对象、箭头对象均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>，源、靶、单位均为恒等，复合是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\times_I I\\cong I\">\\(I\\times_I I\\cong I\\)</span> 的规范映射。其外部化投影按对象及箭头公式规范同构于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>。Exercise1.10.6(iii) 的严格指数具有纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\pi_C,\\pi_D)\">\\(\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\pi_C,\\pi_D)\\)</span>。由前述局部同构、积保持以及内部指数的泛性质，有对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 自然的范畴同构链：</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ext}(D^C)_I\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{IFun}(D_I,D^C)\\\\\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{IFun}(D_I\\times C,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\pi_{D_I}\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\pi_C,\\pi_D)\\\\\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\pi_C,\\pi_D)\n=\\bigl(\\pi_D^{\\pi_C}\\bigr)_I.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Ext}(D^C)_I\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{IFun}(D_I,D^C)\\\\\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{IFun}(D_I\\times C,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\pi_{D_I}\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\pi_C,\\pi_D)\\\\\n&amp;\\cong\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\pi_C,\\pi_D)\n=\\bigl(\\pi_D^{\\pi_C}\\bigr)_I.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><ul>\n<li>第一同构将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:I\\to(D^C)_0\">\\(x:I\\to(D^C)_0\\)</span> 送到相应离散域内部函子，箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:I\\to(D^C)_1\">\\(a:I\\to(D^C)_1\\)</span> 送到内部自然变换，源靶条件给其逆。其余同构取上述已经明确的外部化作用与内部指数转置。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>，两侧重索引分别是预复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 与预复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_I\\to\\operatorname{dom}_J\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_I\\to\\operatorname{dom}_J\\)</span>；每一步都与这项预复合相容。因此这些同构逐纤维给出严格索引范畴同构。总箭头唯一分解成垂直箭头后接指定提升；在垂直部分用上述同构、在提升上保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，便组装出同基底的函子及逐纤维逆。严格换基相容给单位、复合保持，所以得到末式的分裂纤维化同构。若选另一满足Hypothesis中自然Hom范畴同构的指数，其与该具体指数的唯一表示同构运输此结论。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs，Proposition7.3.8及证明，印刷425–426／PDF445–446；严格指数纤维的定义来自Exercise1.10.6(iii)，印刷116–117／PDF136–137。原书把指数保持的最后一步留作展开定义；上面是本轮实际补写的逐纤维构造与组装论证。此前未独立展开指数保持的证据边界已由这项本地证明补足；没有进行机器证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-externalization","status":"resolved","id":"e85a3cc0dff01389","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-externalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"75d304b3477bee01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration-category","status":"resolved","id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定足够大的 Grothendieck 宇宙，所有下述对象集、箭头集和结构族均在其中编码。$\\mathcal B$ 有指定有限极限；积配对、积箭头及拉回配对采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-internal-category]] 的泛性质。$C,D,T$ 为 $\\mathcal B$ 中的内部范畴，源靶为 $s,t$，内部复合按 $(g,f)$ 排列。内部函子恒等与复合逐分量计算。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"75d304b3477bee01","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定足够大的 Grothendieck 宇宙，所有下述对象集、箭头集和结构族均在其中编码。$\\mathcal B$ 有指定有限极限；积配对、积箭头及拉回配对采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-internal-category]] 的泛性质。$C,D,T$ 为 $\\mathcal B$ 中的内部范畴，源靶为 $s,t$，内部复合按 $(g,f)$ 排列。内部函子恒等与复合逐分量计算。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration-category","status":"resolved","id":"3af0cd796b55bbd7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar p=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa_p)$、$\\bar q=(\\mathcal D,q,\\kappa_q)$、$\\bar r=(\\mathcal R,r,\\kappa_r)$ 为 [[16-df-split-fibration-category]] 的 $\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)$ 对象；该记号保留分裂选择。$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{NatTrans}$ 使用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]] 的精确接口。$\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)$、$\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)$ 按下文的六元组构造；只有在已固定同一分裂时才省略横线。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-transformation-definition","status":"resolved","id":"25140205ca0312de","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar p=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa_p)$、$\\bar q=(\\mathcal D,q,\\kappa_q)$、$\\bar r=(\\mathcal R,r,\\kappa_r)$ 为 [[16-df-split-fibration-category]] 的 $\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)$ 对象；该记号保留分裂选择。$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{NatTrans}$ 使用 [[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]] 的精确接口。$\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)$、$\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)$ 按下文的六元组构造；只有在已固定同一分裂时才省略横线。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"积箭头公式中，$C',D'$ 也为内部范畴，$F\\in O_{C,C'}$、$G\\in O_{D,D'}$；$\\bar p',\\bar q'$ 为同一基底上的分裂纤维化，$H\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar p'}$、$K\\in O_{\\bar q,\\bar q'}$。$H\\boxtimes K$ 从 $\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D$ 到相应目标总范畴的同基底积；$\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal E$ 使用 [[16-df-functor]] 中对象、箭头两分量均为恒等函数的记录。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-externalization","status":"resolved","id":"e85a3cc0dff01389","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ext}(C)$、$\\pi_C$ 及 $\\kappa_C$ 使用 [[16-df-externalization]] 的总范畴、投影和指定分裂。外部化的箭头使用完整记录 $\\langle(I,x),(J,y),u,a\\rangle$。$\\operatorname{Ext}(F)$ 是其间的函子，$\\mathcal X_{C,D}$ 是下面由该作用构造的 Hom 范畴函子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"C,D,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"(g,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar p=(\\mathcal E,p,\\kappa_p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar q=(\\mathcal D,q,\\kappa_q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar r=(\\mathcal R,r,\\kappa_r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NatTrans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)","display":false},{"tex":"C',D'","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in O_{C,C'}","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in O_{D,D'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar p',\\bar q'","display":false},{"tex":"H\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar p'}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in O_{\\bar q,\\bar q'}","display":false},{"tex":"H\\boxtimes K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"C\\times D","display":false},{"tex":"r_C,r_D:C_1\\times D_1\\to C_1,D_1","display":false},{"tex":"P_{C,D}","display":false},{"tex":"s_C\\times s_D","display":false},{"tex":"t_C\\times t_D","display":false},{"tex":"a,b:P_{C,D}\\to C_1\\times D_1","display":false},{"tex":"P_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_1","display":false},{"tex":"!_{P_1}:P_1\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle(I,x),(J,y),u,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ext}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X_{C,D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SExp}(\\bar p,\\bar q;\\bar r,w)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"v:E\\times C\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"w:\\mathcal R\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A^i,\\mathcal A^s","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in O_{E\\times C,D}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in O_{\\bar r\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal G(C,D)&\\coloneqq\\{(F_0:C_0\\to D_0,F_1:C_1\\to D_1)\\mid\ns_DF_1=F_0s_C\\land t_DF_1=F_0t_C\\},\\\\\nO_{C,D}&\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathcal G(C,D)\\mid\nF_1e_C=e_DF_0\\land F_1m_C=m_D\\langle F_1\\pi_1,F_1\\pi_2\\rangle\\},\\\\\nA_{C,D}(F,G)&\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha:C_0\\to D_1\\mid s_D\\alpha=F_0\\land t_D\\alpha=G_0\\},\\\\\nH_{C,D}(F,G)&\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in A_{C,D}(F,G)\\mid\nm_D\\langle G_1,\\alpha s_C\\rangle=m_D\\langle\\alpha t_C,F_1\\rangle\\},\\\\\nM_{C,D}&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_{C,D}\\land\\alpha\\in H_{C,D}(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_{C,D}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&\\coloneqq F,\\qquad t_{C,D}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_{C,D}(F)&\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,e_DF_0\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{C,D}(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,m_D\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D)&\\coloneqq\\langle O_{C,D},M_{C,D},s_{C,D},t_{C,D},e_{C,D},c_{C,D}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\bar p,\\bar q}&\\coloneqq\\{F\\mid\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D)\\land qF=p\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall u:I\\to J)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_J)\\\nF\\kappa_p(u,Y)=\\kappa_q(u,FY)\\},\\\\\nH_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F,G)&\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\mid\\mathrm{NatTrans}_{\\mathcal E,\\mathcal D}(\\alpha:F\\Rightarrow G)\n\\land(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\ q\\alpha_X=\\operatorname{id}_{pX}\\},\\\\\nM_{\\bar p,\\bar q}&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid F,G\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\land\\alpha\\in H_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F,G)\\},\\\\\ns_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle&\\coloneqq F,\\qquad t_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq G,\\\\\ne_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(F)&\\coloneqq\\langle F,F,(\\operatorname{id}_{FX})_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{\\bar p,\\bar q}(\\langle G,H,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle F,H,(\\beta_X\\alpha_X)_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)&\\coloneqq\n\\langle O_{\\bar p,\\bar q},M_{\\bar p,\\bar q},s_{\\bar p,\\bar q},t_{\\bar p,\\bar q},e_{\\bar p,\\bar q},c_{\\bar p,\\bar q}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D))&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Cat}(\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nm_{C\\times D}&\\coloneqq\n\\langle m_C\\langle r_Ca,r_Cb\\rangle,m_D\\langle r_Da,r_Db\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nC\\times D&\\coloneqq\\langle C_0\\times D_0,C_1\\times D_1,s_C\\times s_D,t_C\\times t_D,e_C\\times e_D,m_{C\\times D}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}&\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,\\operatorname{id}_1,\\operatorname{id}_1,\\operatorname{id}_1,!_{P_1}\\rangle,\\\\\nF\\times G&\\coloneqq(F_0\\times G_0,F_1\\times G_1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0},\\operatorname{id}_{C_1}),\n\\qquad (GF)_i\\coloneqq G_iF_i\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(C\\times D)&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\times}&\\coloneqq\\{(X,Y)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\times\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D\\mid pX=qY\\},\\\\\nM_{\\times}&\\coloneqq\\{(f,g)\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E\\times\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D\\mid pf=qg\\},\\\\\ns_{\\times}(f,g)&\\coloneqq(sf,sg),\\qquad t_{\\times}(f,g)\\coloneqq(tf,tg),\\\\\ne_{\\times}(X,Y)&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{id}_X,\\operatorname{id}_Y),\\\\\nc_{\\times}((f',g'),(f,g))&\\coloneqq(f'f,g'g),\\\\\n\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D&\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\times},M_{\\times},s_{\\times},t_{\\times},e_{\\times},c_{\\times}\\rangle,\\\\\n(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_0(X,Y)&\\coloneqq pX,\n\\qquad(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_1(f,g)\\coloneqq pf,\\\\\n\\kappa_{\\times}(u,(X,Y))&\\coloneqq(\\kappa_p(u,X),\\kappa_q(u,Y)),\\\\\n\\bar p\\boxtimes\\bar q&\\coloneqq(\\mathcal E\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal D,\n\\langle(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_0,(p\\times_{\\mathcal B}q)_1\\rangle,\\kappa_{\\times}),\\\\\n\\bar1_{\\mathcal B}&\\coloneqq(\\mathcal B,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal B},\\kappa_{\\mathcal B}),\n\\qquad\\kappa_{\\mathcal B}(u,Y)\\coloneqq u,\\\\\n(H\\boxtimes K)_0(X,Y)&\\coloneqq(HX,KY),\n\\qquad(H\\boxtimes K)_1(f,g)\\coloneqq(Hf,Kg).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar p\\boxtimes\\bar q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B),\n\\qquad\\bar1_{\\mathcal B}\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C)&\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Ext}(C),\\pi_C,\\kappa_C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_0(I,x)&\\coloneqq(I,F_0x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_1\\langle(I,x),(J,y),u,a\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle(I,F_0x),(J,F_0y),u,F_1a\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ext}(F)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_0,\\operatorname{Ext}(F)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Ext}(\\alpha))_{(I,x)}&\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,F_0x),(I,G_0x),\\operatorname{id}_I,\\alpha x\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_0(F)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(F),\\\\\n(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_1\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{Ext}(F),\\operatorname{Ext}(G),\\operatorname{Ext}(\\alpha)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal X_{C,D}&\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_0,(\\mathcal X_{C,D})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}\\bigl(\\mathcal X_{C,D},\\operatorname{IFun}(C,D),\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D))\\bigr)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_0(F)&\\coloneqq v(F\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_1\\langle F,G,\\alpha\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle v(F\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),v(G\\times\\operatorname{Id}^{\\rm int}_C),v_1(\\alpha\\times e_C)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A^i_{T,v}&\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_0,(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,v)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nv\\in O_{E\\times C,D}\\land(\\forall T)\\bigl[\\mathrm{IntCat}_{\\mathcal B}(T)\\Rightarrow\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}(\\mathcal A^i_{T,v},\\operatorname{IFun}(T,E),\\operatorname{IFun}(T\\times C,D))\\bigr],\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_0(H)&\\coloneqq w(H\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),\\\\\n(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\left\\langle w(H\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),w(K\\boxtimes\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}),\n\\bigl(w(\\alpha_Z,\\operatorname{id}_X)\\bigr)_{(Z,X)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal T\\times_{\\mathcal B}\\mathcal E)}\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w}&\\coloneqq\\langle(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_0,(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w})_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{SExp}(\\bar p,\\bar q;\\bar r,w)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in O_{\\bar r\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q}\n\\land(\\forall\\bar t=(\\mathcal T,t,\\kappa_t)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{SplitFib}(\\mathcal B))\\\\\n&\\hspace{8mm}\\mathrm{IsoFunctor}(\\mathcal A^s_{\\bar t,w},\n\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar t,\\bar r),\\operatorname{SF}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar t\\boxtimes\\bar p,\\bar q)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\bar p,\\bar q)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists F\\in O_{\\bar p,\\bar q})(\\exists G\\in O_{\\bar q,\\bar p})\\\nGF=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E}\\land FG=\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal D}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(\\mathbf1_{\\mathcal B}),\\bar1_{\\mathcal B})&,\n\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitIso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C\\times D),\\mathsf{ExtObj}(C)\\boxtimes\\mathsf{ExtObj}(D))&,\n\\\\\n\\mathrm{IExp}(C,D;E,